## CompozyOS {{ .Version }}

CompozyOS is one complete environment to create, automate, and supervise agent work: loops, triggers, memory, permissions, and approvals come built in.

### Installation

#### npm
```bash
{{- if eq .Env.NPM_TAG "beta" }}
npm install -g @compozy/cli@beta
{{- else }}
npm install -g @compozy/cli@latest
{{- end }}
```

#### Go Install
```bash
go install github.com/compozy/compozy@{{ .Tag }}
```

#### Verified Binary Installer
```bash
curl -fsSL https://compozy.com/install.sh | sh
```

The installer downloads the configured v0.3 archive for macOS or Linux, uses local `cosign` when
present or a pinned temporary verifier when absent, verifies it against `checksums.txt`, installs
`compozy`, and starts `compozy install` when an interactive terminal is available.

#### Binary Download
Download the appropriate `compozy_<os>_<arch>.tar.gz` asset for your platform and extract it.

